{
  "slug": "plugin-manager",
  "name": "Plugin Manager",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Visual web UI for managing Claude Code plugins. Opens as a standalone browser window with an Anthropic-styled interface. Browse all installed plugins with detailed views of skills, agents, commands, hooks, MCP servers, and modes. Toggle plugins enabled/disabled with one click.\nSearch across plugin names, descriptions, and skill names. Filter by source (Official/Community) and status. Explore the marketplace with  available plugins. Features dark mode, keyboard shortcuts, toast notifications, SSE live updates, and secure localhost-only auth.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `open` (Open the Plugin Manager UI in the browser).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install plugin-manager@claude-community` from `DVKolm/claude-plugin-manager`.\n\nA visual web UI for managing Claude Code plugins. Browse installed plugins, toggle enabled/disabled, search by skills and features, and explore the marketplace — all from a clean, Anthropic-styled interface.",
